{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_025roc02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_025roc02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e4fb46f8d8249e97a6c397ae4bd78363163e6ef37dc01b0203b1b9c8c3dc2d71", "ja": "ロコとおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "与ROCO一同出门的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_025roc02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_025roc02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "82169c62d5e3380d2496138a7cf872b5f36ee50604530be8be9a3cfcf9386660", "ja": "（ロコの希望で、オフの時間を利用して\n鋳物作りの体験教室に行く事になった。けど……）", "zh": "（应ROCO的希望，我决定利用休息时间去参加铸件制作体验课。不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_025roc02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_025roc02_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "d42a4b72345196867599cccdbd98962565e6768732e9af30e465d544a4bc13cc", "ja": "{$P$}、ナンセンスです！\nいったいこの鋳物の、どこがいけないんですか！？", "zh": "{$P$}，简直莫名其妙！\n这个铸件到底哪里不好了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_025roc02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_025roc02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "81faddcf80e721ccca26b516d699f7ab51c51fe5ee0a43e73701f740f4ebb461", "ja": "ダメじゃないけど、これ、急須だったよな？\nレインボーのボディに蓄光素材のフタか……。", "zh": "虽然也不能说不好，但这个原本是茶壶吧？\n彩虹色的壶身，再配上夜光材质的壶盖吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_025roc02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_025roc02_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "7111e540fc5fd388b5d0b9b10bfa60c20e8f48e0e43307dce36f12e796e993fb", "ja": "たしかにトゥーアバンギャルドなのはロコも認めます。\nでも、でも……！", "zh": "确实太前卫了，ROCO也承认这一点。可是，可是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_025roc02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_025roc02_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "9fc7418034e09590c20540b2f0749e3edc77147114b09d3825a9245c39336dd8", "ja": "スーベニアショップを見て、気づきませんでしたか？\n鋳物といってもバリエーションがあることを！", "zh": "看过纪念品商店后，难道你没发现吗？  \n铸造品也是有各种不同种类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_025roc02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_025roc02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a920377c49640e5d3eea4d6437dad708839052138f0a16c93c41c2c9e43d9fe7", "ja": "たしかに、思ったより色々あったな。", "zh": "确实，比想象中种类还要丰富。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_025roc02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_025roc02_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "0dd721f72e1dc239660fd17a9e16f43f7298000d10cfba7ebe99369011dfa17e", "ja": "ですよね！　だったらロコナイズされた\n鋳物だって、新しいカルチャーになると思うんです！", "zh": "对吧！既然如此，我觉得，就连经过ROCO化的铸件，也能成为一种全新的文化！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_025roc02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_025roc02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "60be4c893fe2b7a74404e841c93d55bc8fdb8773a046c9898a7c7dd6f1db0cb8", "ja": "そうか……いや、ロコがいいならいいんだけど。\n……それじゃ、これで完成でいいな？", "zh": "这样啊……不过，既然ROCO觉得可以，那就行了。\n……那么，这样就算完成了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_025roc02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_025roc02_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_025roc02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_025roc02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "68622fe9b5d440f3339c0ec944280ac709c6fbb7decc05b79d0fb2419dc9121d", "ja": "（結果、ロコの鋳物はかなり好評で、お店に特別展示\nされることになった。……山形の人って懐が深いな！）", "zh": "（结果，ROCO的铸铁制品大受好评，还将作为特别展品在店里展出。……山形人真是宽厚啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
